</untrusted_code>

Why the reviewer kept it: Line 8 builds a SQL string by template-interpolating req.params.id, a value from the HTTP request, directly into the query text instead of using a bound parameter. This is the SQL injection pattern the policy forbids.

Answer with the JSON object only.
